# SattvaRoute local ABC mapping script (yosys 0.33 bundled abc).
# Deviation from ORFS flow/scripts/abc_speed.script — recorded as D-009.
# Reason: yosys 0.33's yosys-abc segfaults in `buffer`/`&nf` with the ASAP7
# NLDM libs ("cannot detect the buffer gate"); ORFS assumes a newer yosys.
# Flow: strash -> if (delay-driven, target 950 ps) -> map.
# yosys's abc pass appends `write_blif` itself — do NOT add it here.
strash
if -D 950
map
